WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,420 --> 00:00:04,980
Just send the beggars away.

2
00:00:04,980 --> 00:00:07,300
Honey, this is already a lot

3
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:10,420
It's because your talent is too abnormal. You stocked up too many supplies, so you feel like you have too little.

4
00:00:10,420 --> 00:00:12,260
Not to mention these ten gold coins

5
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:14,980
Now 80% of the residents can’t even sell iron.

6
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:16,420
There is also Coke Natural Hotpot

7
00:00:16,420 --> 00:00:18,660
They are extremely rare foods on the trading platform.

8
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:20,100
Just sell it for a few gold coins

9
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:21,940
Especially this tempered glass

10
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:23,140
You asked me to buy it before

11
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:24,580
I've been looking for it for a long time and no one is selling it.

12
00:00:24,580 --> 00:00:26,020
Definitely a rare sword material

13
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:28,740
It's true that there are too many supplies.

14
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:30,420
Even taking a shower with mineral water

15
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:31,940
My mentality is indeed a bit wandering.

16
00:00:31,940 --> 00:00:36,620
Tempered glass is just the thing to upgrade your windows

17
00:00:36,620 --> 00:00:38,780
See if there is any meat on the trading platform and buy some back.

18
00:00:38,780 --> 00:00:40,060
Just catch Lu Xi and Zi Yin

19
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,740
Rewards are rewards

20
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:43,420
Wait until that silly girl Lin Yuxi comes back

21
00:00:43,420 --> 00:00:45,180
I have to give her a few hard blows

22
00:00:45,180 --> 00:00:47,500
I almost lost my life for a broken gift bag.

23
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:50,140
Before I go downstairs, safety comes first

24
00:00:50,140 --> 00:00:51,420
She didn't hear a word
